WEBVTT

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:45.020
Thirty years ago, the world was struck by an
unknown phenomenon known as a spacequake.

00:00:47.360 --> 00:00:52.690
The beings who may or may not have
intentionally caused these spacequakes

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:54.610
were called Spirits.

00:00:55.610 --> 00:00:59.080
But their existence was hidden from the world

00:01:01.790 --> 00:01:05.790
And now I, Itsuka Shidou, am...

00:01:08.880 --> 00:01:11.300
Dig in, Shido!

00:01:11.300 --> 00:01:14.050
No need to hold back. Have a bite!

00:01:14.090 --> 00:01:18.550
Episode 1

00:01:14.090 --> 00:01:18.550
The 7th Spirit

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:17.760
Uh... What is this?

00:01:17.760 --> 00:01:18.550
Foolish question.

00:01:19.050 --> 00:01:20.050
It is a hot pot.

00:01:20.050 --> 00:01:24.810
We all wanted to make you something, so we made this.

00:01:25.140 --> 00:01:27.560
Thanks, but...

00:01:28.190 --> 00:01:31.320
What'd you put in here to make it this color?

00:01:32.440 --> 00:01:34.070
We used only the finest ingredients.

00:01:34.400 --> 00:01:37.610
Each of us put in our favorite foods.

00:01:39.700 --> 00:01:42.040
W-Wow, isn't that nice, Shidou?

00:01:42.040 --> 00:01:44.910
They made this delicious-looking dish all for you.

00:01:44.910 --> 00:01:47.080
Get it while it's hot!

00:01:51.710 --> 00:01:53.960
You should add something too, Kotori!

00:01:53.960 --> 00:01:57.010
Add the final touch to complete this masterpiece!

00:02:07.730 --> 00:02:10.360
Kotori's put her food in too!

00:02:10.360 --> 00:02:12.480
Now it'll be even tastier.

00:02:29.420 --> 00:02:30.380
Wait...

00:02:30.380 --> 00:02:31.500
How is it, Shido?

00:02:32.130 --> 00:02:33.800
It's actually not bad.

00:02:36.010 --> 00:02:36.670
We did it!

00:02:36.670 --> 00:02:37.880
I'm so happy!

00:02:38.720 --> 00:02:41.220
Thank you all!

00:02:42.350 --> 00:02:46.430
Your fried chicken really pulls it together, Yuzuru.

00:02:46.430 --> 00:02:49.350
Objection: It was your karaage, Kaguya.

00:02:49.350 --> 00:02:51.730
It rounded out the flavor.

00:02:51.730 --> 00:02:53.900
Huh?! It was all you, Yuzuru.

00:02:53.900 --> 00:02:55.820
Assertion: No, it was thanks to you, Kaguya.

00:02:55.820 --> 00:02:57.610
You two are as close as ever.

00:02:57.610 --> 00:03:02.570
Let's just call it a miraculous collaboration of everyone's ingredients.

00:03:02.570 --> 00:03:06.620
The show I saw on TV was right. You <i>can</i> put anything in a hot pot and it'll taste good.

00:03:06.620 --> 00:03:11.540
Yeah, the color of this hot pot wouldn't make you think that.

00:03:11.540 --> 00:03:14.630
I wish Miku could've made it too.

00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:16.800
Work is work though.

00:03:16.800 --> 00:03:18.630
Darling!

00:03:19.220 --> 00:03:20.880
Did you call for me?

00:03:23.680 --> 00:03:24.510
Hi!

00:03:24.510 --> 00:03:31.640
Hearing your lonely calls, the Spirit Idol,
Izayoi Miku, has arrived to brighten your days!

00:03:31.640 --> 00:03:32.980
Miku?!

00:03:33.690 --> 00:03:35.480
Then who's that singing?

00:03:35.480 --> 00:03:37.860
It's a recording that looks like it's live.

00:03:38.110 --> 00:03:42.990
So why are you all here? Is this some kind of party?

00:03:43.410 --> 00:03:47.490
Oh, now that I think about it,
today might have been my birthday!

00:03:47.490 --> 00:03:51.160
I'll take a passionate kiss from all of you as a present!

00:03:52.790 --> 00:03:54.130
What are you doing?!

00:03:54.130 --> 00:03:56.250
Protection: Kaguya barrier.

00:03:56.250 --> 00:03:58.300
Wh-What?!

00:03:58.300 --> 00:04:01.880
Stop, Miku! Get back into the TV!

00:04:01.880 --> 00:04:02.760
Yuzuru!

00:04:03.550 --> 00:04:04.800
Miku!

00:04:04.800 --> 00:04:07.390
What are you doing?!

00:04:11.060 --> 00:04:12.810
Stop!

00:04:21.820 --> 00:04:26.070
Oh, so that's why you were all eating a hot pot.

00:04:26.320 --> 00:04:29.490
Well in any case, I'm glad you're here.

00:04:29.490 --> 00:04:31.500
Be careful, it's hot.

00:04:32.080 --> 00:04:34.500
Wow, what a poisonous color.

00:04:34.790 --> 00:04:36.920
Let's have a taste!

00:04:36.920 --> 00:04:37.750
Hot!

00:04:37.750 --> 00:04:40.920
Are you okay?! I warned you.

00:04:40.920 --> 00:04:45.010
Darling, I think I burnt my lips.

00:04:45.340 --> 00:04:48.390
I don't think they'll heal without a kiss.

00:04:51.850 --> 00:04:53.890
What are you doing, Miku?!

00:04:53.890 --> 00:04:55.980
Burns don't heal like that!

00:04:55.980 --> 00:04:57.150
Intense pain:

00:04:57.150 --> 00:05:00.730
