00:08:15.890 --> 00:08:17.260
Everyone, make your choices!

00:08:17.260 --> 00:08:19.270
I'm here for one thing: To meet you.

00:08:17.260 --> 00:08:19.270
I-I don't know. I couldn't get away fast enough and ended up here...

00:08:17.260 --> 00:08:19.270
Why don't we put that aside and I get to fondling your boobs?

00:08:17.260 --> 00:08:19.270
I'm here for one thing: To meet you.

00:08:19.680 --> 00:08:22.310
Yeah, that's about right.

00:08:22.310 --> 00:08:24.060
