00:13:45.010 --> 00:13:47.930
J-Just say something first before you do it next time.

00:13:48.430 --> 00:13:50.850
At least that way, I'll be more mentally prepared.

00:13:50.850 --> 00:13:53.390
No, listen. I haven't doneвЂ”

00:13:54.680 --> 00:13:55.430
Origami?!

00:13:55.430 --> 00:13:59.230
