00:15:16.930 --> 00:15:19.140
Wow, he's way too impulsive.

00:15:19.140 --> 00:15:21.650
You can't just play this off as boys being boys!

00:15:21.650 --> 00:15:22.900
So gross.

00:15:23.150 --> 00:15:25.860
In any case, we're gonna get you back!

00:15:25.860 --> 00:15:30.150
You've looked down on the Yamai sisters and you will pay the price!

00:15:30.700 --> 00:15:33.780
Specifically, we're going to take off your underwear!

00:15:33.780 --> 00:15:39.540
Confirmation: And I will spray your entire body with water.

00:15:39.830 --> 00:15:42.290
Listen, I didn't do anything!

00:15:42.290 --> 00:15:43.420
Itsuka-kun,

00:15:43.420 --> 00:15:45.840
