This guy's a fake!

00:18:13.730 --> 00:18:17.200
He transformed into me and has been doing all these terrible things to everyone!

00:18:17.200 --> 00:18:17.860
WhaвЂ”

00:18:18.200 --> 00:18:19.990
Don't be fooled! I'm the real one!

00:18:19.990 --> 00:18:22.700
Shut up! I'm the real one!

00:18:24.330 --> 00:18:28.000
So one of them is a fake?

00:18:28.670 --> 00:18:30.630
This is a strange situation.

00:18:30.630 --> 00:18:32.630
But, if I had to say...

00:18:33.130 --> 00:18:34.630
But you're the fake!

00:18:33.130 --> 00:18:34.630
You're the fake!

00:18:36.090 --> 00:18:38.130
Wh-What are you saying?!

00:18:38.630 --> 00:18:39.680
I'm the real”

00:18:39.680 --> 00:18:41.390
You're not Shido!

00:18:41.760 --> 00:18:45.560
You might look exactly like him, but you don't smell like him.

00:18:45.560 --> 00:18:48.890
If it was just you here, we might have been fooled.

00:18:49.190 --> 00:18:53.150
But with the real Shidou right next to you, it's easy.

00:18:51.900 --> 00:18:53.150
Shidou A

00:18:51.900 --> 00:18:53.150
Shidou B

00:18:53.480 --> 00:18:57.650
You blink five milliseconds faster than the real Shidou.

00:18:57.940 --> 00:19:01.570
Your resting stance is 0.2 degrees more to the left.

00:19:01.570 --> 00:19:03.080
There's no mistaking it!

00:19:03.330 --> 00:19:05.240
What's wrong with these two?

00:19:05.240 --> 00:19:06.620
Are they crazy?

00:19:06.620 --> 00:19:09.080
Well, I can't really deny that...

00:19:10.750 --> 00:19:12.080
Impossible!

00:19:12.080 --> 00:19:14.500
Impossible! Impossible!

00:19:16.130 --> 00:19:17.090
Impossible!

00:19:21.010 --> 00:19:22.470
You're...

00:19:22.470 --> 00:19:24.180
I won't forgive you!

00:19:24.180 --> 00:19:29.940
Not only did you see my true form,
but you saw through my perfect disguise.

00:19:29.940 --> 00:19:33.190
I won't let you get away with this!

00:19:33.190 --> 00:19:35.690
Don't think this is over!

00:19:38.900 --> 00:19:40.450
W-Wait!

00:19:44.450 --> 00:19:47.910
Shido, who was that?

00:19:47.910 --> 00:19:50.080
What are you to her?

00:19:50.080 --> 00:19:52.830
Um, well, that's...

00:20:01.010 --> 00:20:02.340
<i>It's been five days since then.</i>

00:20:02.800 --> 00:20:05.600
<i>She hasn't done anything yet.</i>

00:20:05.930 --> 00:20:08.060
<i>What's going on?</i>

00:20:11.850 --> 00:20:14.980
Oh, I thought this was the couch, but it was you, Shidou.

00:20:14.980 --> 00:20:17.230
Kotori, you...

00:20:17.230 --> 00:20:19.610
Aren't you a little too relaxed?

00:20:19.610 --> 00:20:23.320
We may not know the reason,
but Natsumi has declared you an enemy.

00:20:23.320 --> 00:20:27.490
If you don't raise her affection levels, you won't be able to seal her powers.

00:20:27.740 --> 00:20:29.450
I-I know that.

00:20:29.450 --> 00:20:33.000
We don't know when she'll appear next, but...

00:20:33.460 --> 00:20:35.880
Look, this was in the mailbox.

00:20:36.380 --> 00:20:36.500
Natsumi

00:20:36.420 --> 00:20:37.630
What is it?

00:20:36.500 --> 00:20:36.630
Natsumi

00:20:36.630 --> 00:20:36.750
Natsumi

00:20:38.710 --> 00:20:42.760
I haven't opened it, but I confirmed it's not dangerous.

00:20:43.050 --> 00:20:46.640
It shouldn't explode or anything.

00:20:49.310 --> 00:20:50.100
These are...

00:20:51.270 --> 00:20:53.350
A picture of me?

00:20:56.400 --> 00:20:57.730
There are twelve of them.

00:20:58.570 --> 00:20:59.440
And this.

00:21:01.280 --> 00:21:03.030
"I'm in one of these.

00:21:03.860 --> 00:21:06.450
Can you guess which one?

00:21:06.950 --> 00:21:09.160
Find out before anyone disappears.

00:21:09.160 --> 00:21:10.240
Natsumi."

00:21:10.240 --> 00:21:11.750
What does that mean?

00:21:12.250 --> 00:21:15.250
If we take the message literally,

00:21:15.250 --> 00:21:22.510
it means that Natsumi's most likely transformed into one of these twelve people.

00:21:22.960 --> 00:21:24.590
One of them?

00:21:24.590 --> 00:21:25.380
And that means

00:21:26.590 --> 00:21:29.140
I'm a suspect too.

00:21:30.930 --> 00:21:34.060
Shidou, this is Natsumi calling you out.

00:21:34.680 --> 00:21:37.440
My guess is that if you don't figure out who she is,

00:21:37.940 --> 00:21:40.820
one of these people will disappear forever.

00:21:42.650 --> 00:21:44.280
You have to do it Shidou...

00:21:44.950 --> 00:21:47.030
before we disappear.

00:21:59.880 --> 00:22:01.090
"Date."

00:22:01.090 --> 00:22:04.010
A sweet, sad, yet lovely word.

00:22:04.590 --> 00:22:08.680
After a long wait, the curtain is raised for the third time.

00:22:21.190 --> 00:22:26.860
At first it was just a blurred line

00:22:26.860 --> 00:22:32.330
That suddenly came into focus

00:22:32.330 --> 00:22:38.040
All the doubt and pain I've been hiding

00:22:38.040 --> 00:22:43.630
I entrusted it all to you

00:22:43.630 --> 00:22:46.420
If it's with you, I can go forward without doubt

00:22:46.420 --> 00:22:49.220
I can entrust myself to you

00:22:49.220 --> 00:22:52.300
I'll be by your side no matter when

00:22:52.300 --> 00:22:55.140
I can feel it

00:22:55.140 --> 00:22:57.140
Date A Live

00:22:58.390 --> 00:23:00.690
Let's kiss once again

00:23:00.690 --> 00:23:04.110
The moment we close our eyes

00:23:04.110 --> 00:23:06.320
I can feel our gazes come together

00:23:06.320 --> 00:23:09.610
There's no turning back from this

00:23:09.610 --> 00:23:12.160
It might seem familiar, but it's a different memory

00:23:12.160 --> 00:23:13.780
One day, I swear

00:23:13.780 --> 00:23:21.040
I'll make a future that's different than the painted scenery here right now

00:23:21.040 --> 00:23:26.960
In this spinning world of countless encounters

00:23:26.960 --> 00:23:34.100
Let's begin our date

00:23:36.260 --> 00:23:40.980
Episode 2

00:23:36.260 --> 00:23:40.980
Can you find me?
